lilee <code>21:1</code></td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">References are to chapter and verse in each gospel. Mark 16:9-20 is absent from Codex Sinaiticus and Codex Vaticanus and is widely held to be a later addition (scholarly consensus).</figcaption></figure>
